<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, blessed are our eyes that see,</l><l>Our ears, how blessed to hear;</l><l>Things angels ne’er could look into</l><l>Are now to us made clear.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our sense is corporate, bold and strong,</l><l>His grace, how free to take;</l><l>Encouraging the others on,</l><l>Run for the kingdom’s sake.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We’re weary not this race to run,</l><l>It makes our joy complete;</l><l>For this we know, around the bend,</l><l>The Lord we’ll surely meet.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
